# Connection strings and test-account passwords live in the home folder
# (~/.clarity-backup.env, ~/.clarity-test.env, ~/.clarity-test-accounts.env).
# These lines stop a copy of any of them ever being committed.
.clarity-*
*clarity-test-accounts*
